# Canonical production origin. Drives metadataBase, canonical + hreflang
# tags, sitemap.xml, robots.txt and the JSON-LD @id/url fields.
#
# Write a real origin, with no angle brackets and no trailing slash:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://ravand.co
#
# A bare host also works (https:// is added for you):
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=ravand.co
#
# This variable is OPTIONAL. On Vercel, the project's production domain is
# used automatically when it is unset or malformed, so a bad value can no
# longer fail the build (see lib/site.ts).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://ravand.co
